sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant ChatGPT
    participant Plexora MCP
    participant Plexora DB
    participant Wix API

    Note over User,Wix API: Single Tool Call - Returns Interactive Widget
    User->>ChatGPT: "I want to book a slot at a nearby barber shop"
    ChatGPT->>Plexora MCP: Call booking_widget tool
    Plexora MCP-->>ChatGPT: Return interactive widget (resource)
    ChatGPT->>User: Display booking widget
    
    Note over User,Wix API: Widget UI Handles All Flow (clicks/input)
    
        activate Plexora MCP
        Plexora MCP->>Plexora DB: Fetch nearby barber shops
        Plexora DB-->>Plexora MCP: Return shops list
        Plexora MCP->>User: Display shops in widget
        
        User->>Plexora MCP: Click on shop (Gentlemen Point)
        Plexora MCP->>Wix API: Fetch services & staff members
        Wix API-->>Plexora MCP: Return services & staff data
        Plexora MCP->>User: Navigate to services page in widget
        
        User->>Plexora MCP: Click on service (Beard trim with Mario)
        Plexora MCP->>Wix API: Fetch available slots (current day)
        Wix API-->>Plexora MCP: Return available slots
        Plexora MCP->>User: Navigate to slots page in widget
        
        loop Date changes via calendar
            User->>Plexora MCP: Click calendar (change day)
            Plexora MCP->>Wix API: Fetch available slots (new day)
            Wix API-->>Plexora MCP: Return available slots
            Plexora MCP->>User: Update slots in widget
        end
        
        User->>Plexora MCP: Click time slot (10AM)
        Plexora MCP->>User: Navigate to booking form in widget
        
        User->>Plexora MCP: Input info & submit form<br/>(Name: John Doe, Email: johndoe@example.com)
        Plexora MCP->>Wix API: Create booking
        Wix API-->>Plexora MCP: Booking confirmation & ID
        Plexora MCP->>User: Display confirmation page in widget
        deactivate Plexora MCP
    

